Hako
========

This project reimplements userspace protocols informed by public reverse
engineering, vendor documentation and open-source projects. No source code
from the projects below is included; they were consulted for device IDs,
packet layouts and behaviour only. Per-protocol citations live in each
driver's module documentation under daemon/src/drivers/<vendor>/.

Protocol references (not vendored):
- OpenRazer (GPL-2.0) and the uchroma protocol notes - Razer report layout,
  transaction ids, per-model features
- Solaar (GPL-2.0), libratbag (MIT), Logitech cpg-docs, openlogi.org -
  Logitech HID++ 1.0/2.0 features and receiver pairing
- HeadsetControl (GPL-3.0) - SteelSeries, HyperX and Logitech headset commands
- rivalcfg (WTFPL) - SteelSeries mouse commands
- OpenRGB (GPL-2.0) - SteelSeries Apex, HyperX, ASUS Aura and Corsair lighting
  layouts and device IDs
- HyperHeadset (MIT), ngenuity-linux-cli, santeri3700 Pulsefire Dart notes
  (CC0) - HyperX headset and mouse protocols
- G-Helper (GPL-3.0), rog-mouse-battery, pelta-control - ASUS ROG mouse and
  headset protocols
- G-Helper (GPL-3.0) PeripheralsProvider, Keyboard and Headset models,
  libratbag (MIT) asus driver - ASUS Omni receiver pairing, mouse debounce
  and DPI stages, ROG keyboard battery, ROG headset lighting and sidetone
- ckb-next (GPL-2.0) and its corsair-protocol docs, OpenLinkHub, Linux
  hid-corsair-void (GPL-2.0), HaloBattery, hs80-battery - Corsair NXP / Bragi
  and headset protocols
- QMK firmware (GPL-2.0) quantum/via.h, quantum/via.c (current and 0.14-0.19
  tags), tmk_core/protocol/usb_descriptor.c; the-via/app (GPL-3.0)
  src/utils/keyboard-api.ts and the-via/reader (GPL-3.0) common menus;
  vial-qmk (GPL-2.0) quantum/via.h / via.c - VIA raw HID command layout,
  lighting channels and value ids
- HeadsetControl (GPL-3.0) - Corsair Void lights / sidetone and Bragi headset
  property behaviour
- HeadsetControl (GPL-3.0), zoneout (MIT), OpenInzone (GPL-3.0) - Sony INZONE
  and PULSE 3D headset protocols
- HeadsetControl (GPL-3.0) - Audeze Maxwell / Maxwell 2 headset protocol
- OpenRGB (GPL-2.0) RoccatController, HeadsetControl (GPL-3.0) roccat_elo_*,
  libratbag (MIT) driver-roccat*.c - ROCCAT / Turtle Beach mouse, keyboard
  and headset layouts and device IDs
- PlasmaNGenuity (MIT), HyperX Saga Control (MIT) - HyperX Pulsefire Dart
  heartbeat and Pulsefire Saga Pro protocol
- OpenRazer (GPL-2.0) razerkraken driver - Razer Kraken headset LED reports
- HeadsetControl (GPL-3.0) - Razer BlackShark V2 Pro (PlayStation) dongle
  framing and battery read
- OpenRazer (GPL-2.0) VARSTORE usage and razer_get_active_varstore, freenapse
  (MIT) src/lighting.rs / src/protocol.rs / FEATURES.md, OpenRGB (GPL-2.0)
  RazerController storage flags, uchroma protocol reference, razercfg
  (GPL-2.0) hw_deathadder_chroma.c - Razer storage byte and onboard profile
  slots (docs/onboard-writes/razer.md)
- mxw (MIT), glorious-gui (MIT), glorious-i2 (MIT), glorious-i2-battery
