- OpenRGB (GPL-2.0) CoolerMasterController, libcmmk (LGPL-3.0) - Cooler
  Master mouse and keyboard lighting layouts and device IDs
- OpenRGB (GPL-2.0) RedragonController, mouse_m908 (GPL-3.0) - Redragon
